{"video":"4c8ORaaVuIw","lines":[{"t":[0,2.8],"en":"Now, the one in the feather boa, that's Dr. Francis."},{"t":[3.4,4.9],"en":"Now, she used to be a man."},{"t":[6.2,7.7],"en":"Okay, oh, look, see, now there's Raven."},{"t":[7.9,8.9],"en":"We hate her."},{"t":[9.5,10.8],"en":"We're glad she's dying."},{"t":[12.3,13.8],"en":"What? What? Marcel?"},{"t":[14.4,15.9],"en":"Are you playing with Monica's shoes?"},{"t":[16.2,17.8],"en":"You know you're not supposed to play..."},{"t":[17.8,18.3],"en":"Whoa."},{"t":[19.6,20.2],"en":"Whoa."},{"t":[21.1,23.5],"en":"Marcel, did you poo in the shoes?"},{"t":[24.3,25.6],"en":"Oh, Marcel, man."},{"t":[26.5,28.8],"en":"Oh, God."},{"t":[30,35.7],"en":"Sorry, Barry."},{"t":[36.7,38.5],"en":"A little engagement gift."},{"t":[39.3,40.9],"en":"I'm sure you didn't register for that."},{"t":[44.2,45.1],"en":"I swear."},{"t":[49.4,50.7],"en":"Who died? Who died?"},{"t":[52,52.9],"en":"Roll him over!"},{"t":[53.2,54.3],"en":"Oh, come on, roll him over!"},{"t":[54.5,59.1],"en":"Oh, well, we know it wasn't Dexter, right, Marcel?"},{"t":[59.3,60.6],"en":"You could..."},{"t":[65.1,66.4],"en":"How could you lose him?"},{"t":[66.7,67.9],"en":"I don't know, I don't know."},{"t":[67.9,70.4],"en":"We were watching TV, and then he pooped in Monica's shoe."},{"t":[70.7,71.1],"en":"Wait."},{"t":[71.6,72.8],"en":"He pooped in my shoe?"},{"t":[73.8,74.6],"en":"Which one?"},{"t":[74.8,75.7],"en":"I don't know."},{"t":[76.1,76.9],"en":"The left one."},{"t":[77,77.1],"en":"No."},{"t":[78,78.9],"en":"Which ones?"},{"t":[79.1,82.2],"en":"Oh, oh, those little clunky Amish things you think go with everything."},{"t":[84.5,85],"en":"Hey."},{"t":[85.4,85.6],"en":"Hi."},{"t":[85.6,85.8],"en":"Hey."},{"t":[86,86.7],"en":"Whoa, oh."},{"t":[87.3,88.8],"en":"Why is the air in here so negative?"},{"t":[91.2,92.4],"en":"Rachel lost Marcel."},{"t":[93.3,94.2],"en":"Oh, no, how?"},{"t":[94.4,95.7],"en":"He pooped in my shoe."},{"t":[96,96.7],"en":"Which one?"},{"t":[96.8,98.6],"en":"Those cute little black ones I wear all the time."},{"t":[99.4,100.2],"en":"No, which one?"},{"t":[101.4,102.6],"en":"The right or left?"},{"t":[104.2,105.7],"en":"Because the left one is lucky."},{"t":[106.5,107.4],"en":"Come on, you guys."},{"t":[107.4,108],"en":"What are we going to do?"},{"t":[108,108.6],"en":"What are we going to do?"},{"t":[108.7,109.3],"en":"All right, all right, all right."},{"t":[109.5,110.1],"en":"You're a monkey."},{"t":[110.7,111.7],"en":"You're loose in the city."},{"t":[112.5,113.3],"en":"Where do you go?"},{"t":[115,118.6],"en":"Okay, it's his first time out, so he's probably going to want to do some of the touristy things."},{"t":[121.8,122.8],"en":"I'll go to Kat's."},{"t":[123.2,124.5],"en":"You go to the Russian tea room."},{"t":[126.3,127.8],"en":"Oh, my God."},{"t":[127.9,129],"en":"Come on, you guys."},{"t":[129.2,130.5],"en":"He's going to be home any minute."},{"t":[130.6,131.6],"en":"He's going to kill me."},{"t":[131.9,132.9],"en":"Okay, we'll start with the building."},{"t":[133.1,134.5],"en":"You guys take the first and second floor."},{"t":[134.6,135.6],"en":"Phoebe and I'll take third and fourth."},{"t":[136.1,136.8],"en":"Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa."},{"t":[136.8,137.4],"en":"What am I going to do?"},{"t":[137.4,137.8],"en":"What am I going to do?"},{"t":[138,139],"en":"Okay, you stay here."},{"t":[139.5,140.5],"en":"Just wait by the phone."},{"t":[140.8,143],"en":"Spray Lysol in my shoe and wait for Ross to kill you."},{"t":[144.3,145.4],"en":"Does anybody want to trade?"},{"t":[149.7,154.8],"en":"What do you want?"},{"t":[155.7,157.4],"en":"Mr. Heckles, our friend lost a monkey."},{"t":[157.5,158.1],"en":"Have you seen it?"},{"t":[159.1,161],"en":"I left a Belgian waffle out here."},{"t":[161,161.6],"en":"Did you take it?"},{"t":[162.1,162.5],"en":"No."},{"t":[163.2,165.2],"en":"Why would you leave your Belgian waffle in the hall?"},{"t":[165.9,167.2],"en":"I wasn't ready for it."},{"t":[167.8,168.4],"en":"The monkey."},{"t":[168.5,169.5],"en":"Have you seen a monkey?"},{"t":[169.5,172.8],"en":"I saw Regis Philbin once."},{"t":[173.6,174.9],"en":"Okay, thank you, Mr. Markle."},{"t":[176.5,177.5],"en":"You owe me your waffle."},{"t":[179.5,179.8],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[180.2,183.2],"en":"He's a black capuchin monkey with a white face,"},{"t":[184.1,185.6],"en":"with Russian dressing,"},{"t":[185.8,187.4],"en":"and pickles on the side."},{"t":[188.3,188.7],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[189.2,189.6],"en":"Thanks."},{"t":[191.3,191.6],"en":"Hi."},{"t":[191.8,193.4],"en":"Hey, how did it go today?"},{"t":[193.4,193.5],"en":"Hey, how did it go today?"},{"t":[193.5,194.4],"en":"Oh, great."},{"t":[194.5,194.7],"en":"Yeah?"},{"t":[194.8,195.6],"en":"It went great."},{"t":[196.1,196.7],"en":"Really great."},{"t":[196.7,197.4],"en":"Hey, is that wine?"},{"t":[197.9,198.2],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[198.6,198.8],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[198.9,200.5],"en":"You want some?"},{"t":[200.5,201.9],"en":"Oh, I would love some."},{"t":[202.1,202.2],"en":"Yeah?"},{"t":[202.6,203.4],"en":"But you know what?"},{"t":[203.4,203.8],"en":"You know what?"},{"t":[203.8,204.7],"en":"Let's not drink it here."},{"t":[205.2,206.4],"en":"I'm feeling kind of crazy."},{"t":[206.7,207.5],"en":"You want to go to Newark?"},{"t":[211.3,212.5],"en":"Uh, okay."},{"t":[212.7,214.2],"en":"Yeah, well, we could do that."},{"t":[214.3,216.7],"en":"But before we head off to the murder capital of the Northeast,"},{"t":[216.9,221.1],"en":"I was, uh, kind of wanted to run something by you."},{"t":[221.9,223.4],"en":"You know how we were, uh, you know,"},{"t":[223.6,227],"en":"talking before about, uh, relationships and stuff?"},{"t":[227.2,227.8],"en":"Well..."},{"t":[227.8,229.6],"en":"Oh, God, Ross, I cannot do this."},{"t":[229.8,230.7],"en":"Okay, quick and painful."},{"t":[240.6,241.3],"en":"Oh, God."},{"t":[242.2,243],"en":"Okay, all right."},{"t":[243.2,243.6],"en":"All right."},{"t":[243.8,244.1],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[245.4,246.7],"en":"Ross, please don't hate me."},{"t":[247.6,248.2],"en":"Oh, what?"},{"t":[248.4,248.7],"en":"What, what?"},{"t":[250.5,251.9],"en":"Uh, you know,"},{"t":[251.9,252.4],"en":"Marcel."},{"t":[254.2,254.7],"en":"Yeah?"},{"t":[255.3,260.3],"en":"Well, I, I kind of, uh, I kind of lost him."}]}
